{{Documentation}}
Given some wikitext, this template outputs both a text version with syntax highlighting and the output from the parser.

It avoid the duplication frequently seen in template documentation, where wikitext is written twice, once in a <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;syntaxhighlight&gt;</code> tag to show the source and once directly on the page to show the output.

See [[dev:Template:Demo]] for more information.

